# Supabase project URL and public anon key (Settings → API) for this **CRM / finance** app only.
# The marketing site should use its own .env.local (often a different Supabase project). See docs/SETUP_CHECKLIST.md.
# In Supabase → Authentication → URL configuration, add this app’s origins (local + production).
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# Optional: public URL of the marketing site (shown as a link from the finance dashboard and CRM top bar).
# VITE_MARKETING_SITE_URL=http://localhost:5173

# Optional: same email you set in SQL for public.crm_user_directory_master() (Team tab / directory master UX).
# Do not commit real addresses in tracked files; use this only in .env.local or Vercel env.
# VITE_CRM_DIRECTORY_MASTER_EMAIL=

# Optional: override lender CSV URL (see src/pages/FinanceDashboardPage.tsx for default published URL)
# VITE_LENDERS_CSV_URL=

# CRM access: run sql/crm_security.sql in Supabase, then grant users via app_metadata or crm_access_allowlist (see file header).
# Existing DBs: run sql/crm_customers_extend.sql once if customer columns (secondary phone, DOB) are missing.
# After deploy: run sql/crm_customers_status_and_activity_author.sql for Lost/active status, last_call_at, and activity author_email.
# After deploy: run sql/crm_customers_assign_directory_author_trigger.sql for lead assignment, team directory, and activity author_email trigger.
# After deploy: run sql/crm_user_directory_display_name_admin.sql for optional team display names and directory admin RLS.
# After deploy: run sql/crm_directory_delegated_admins.sql so the master account can delegate directory admins (display names + history moderation).
# If delete/admin UI fails: run sql/crm_directory_set_master_email.sql with your CRM sign-in email, then sql/crm_customers_delete_rpc.sql.
# Optional admin RPC for pre-approval audit rows: run sql/crm_public_preapproval_leads_admin_delete.sql once.
# Dismiss individual alerts: run sql/crm_notifications_delete.sql once.
# After deploy: run sql/crm_activities_admin_delete_comments.sql so directory admins can delete call/comment rows (RLS).
# After deploy: run sql/crm_activities_kind_text.sql so activities can use kind 'text' (SMS / text thread).
# After deploy: run sql/crm_customers_creator_assign_and_email.sql for creator email snapshot, default assignee, and creator-field lock.
# After deploy: run sql/crm_public_preapproval_leads.sql on the **CRM** project so CRM can list web leads (needs user_has_crm_access).
# Marketing bridge: run sql/crm_marketing_ingest_bridge.sql, deploy Edge Function ingest-marketing-preapproval, set MARKETING_WEBHOOK_SECRET — see docs/CRM_BRIDGE.md.
# If website phone is optional: run sql/crm_marketing_ingest_phone_optional.sql then re-run sql/crm_marketing_ingest_bridge.sql on CRM Supabase.
# Optional lead email alerts (Resend): Edge Function secrets RESEND_API_KEY + LEAD_NOTIFY_CONFIG (JSON) on CRM Supabase — see docs/CRM_BRIDGE.md.
# If the site uses a separate Supabase project, also run sql/crm_public_preapproval_leads_marketing_project.sql on that project.
# After deploy: run sql/crm_customers_admin_delete.sql so directory admins can delete customer profiles.
# After deploy: run sql/crm_customers_system_website_creator.sql so website leads show "System - Website app" as creator.
# Credit app document uploads (driver's licence, paystubs, trade registration): run sql/crm_credit_app_documents_storage.sql once.
